EB-W52qlfJHCeYWL_4xjyynApmoY9ES84WSjba3y-KrMcBBYsqgsFv3UZpvH93I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvStxhacf9QbPpf38xMyI6V048zr-Q7GDUJIo4YDdSRrA&oe=69999F40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer COver.png", "id": "1288041185499986", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982466_1288041188833319_1651999487860440247_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oBiES_853agQ7kNvwFp5Mf4&_nc_oc=Adkb9Gdo4YLHZpKgomyvCtAJ5eOfQdrD-qopnaacnumaGAGfC1fnX0wOfVH48KUSp7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftaTKnmkYuQyn0K4A_gq6dwM4e2tIUivkRC-FYukyCieQ&oe=6999A211"}, "display_name": "TinyFins", "keywords": ["cute", "highscore", "underwater", "fish", "mixedreality"], "long_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!\n\nFeatures include:\n- Shark, pufferfish and squid enemies\n- Highscore system with the ability to unlock ranks and trophies\n- Intuitive, flowy controls\n- Collecting fish of different colors", "short_description": "Tiny Fins lets you swim free in an ocean playground, guiding a school of cute fish with a sweep of your hand. Dive past colorful clams, snag bunches of bubbles, and avoid hungry sharks!\n\nWhy you will love it: Super-smooth controls that make sudden sprints and quick pivots a cinch when you\u2019re gliding through the water. They\u2019re a lifesaver when you go from popping a string of bubbles to deftly avoiding a spiky puffer fish!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tiny-fins.com/imprint.html", "developer_terms_of_service_u